title: Splits and tabs
flow: Split the editor right and down, open a file in each split, then start a second tab page and jump back to the first.
open src/main.zig
until "fn main"
record
wait 1000
key "ctrl+\\"
wait 700
key ctrl+p
wait 250
slowtype "util" 80
key enter
until "pub fn sum"
wait 1000
run view.split_down
wait 700
key ctrl+p
wait 250
slowtype "readme" 80
key enter
wait 1400
poster
run view.focus_left
wait 500
keys @90 down down down down down
wait 700
run tab.new
wait 900
key ctrl+p
wait 250
slowtype "changelog" 70
key enter
wait 1500
key alt+1
wait 2000
